      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: darwin_offer
    text: You are kind to ask. I noticed that you own a recording object, very intriguing...
      I am studying the animals of the region here. You would be too kind if you
      could record several sounds from seagulls, whales and seals. Play the sounds
      in the harbor. I'll  be there to listen closely!
    choices:
    - label: I'll help you out!
      nextNodeID: 
